  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/07/IMG_7117.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Ribesalbes ha cogido fuerzas para el d&iacute;a fuerte de las fiestas patronales de San Crist&oacute;bal, este s&aacute;bado, con una paella en el Centro Recreativo y Cultural. Hasta una par de parejas chinas, acompa&ntilde;adas por el cient&iacute;fico Eulogio Oset, se han preparado con el arroz para ver el toro de Aldeaquemada.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellasantcristofolribesalbes/img_7105.jpg\" alt=\"img_7105\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellasantcristofolribesalbes/img_7106.jpg\" alt=\"img_7106\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellasantcristofolribesalbes/img_7107.jpg\" alt=\"img_7107\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellasantcristofolribesalbes/img_7108.jpg\" alt=\"img_7108\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellasantcristofolribesalbes/img_7109.jpg\" alt=\"img_7109\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellasantcristofolribesalbes/img_7110.jpg\" alt=\"img_7110\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellasantcristofolribesalbes/img_7111.jpg\" alt=\"img_7111\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellasantcristofolribesalbes/img_7112.jpg\" alt=\"img_7112\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/paellasantcristofolribesalbes/i